SmartSys Agent (console)
Available modules: Battery Brightness Volume MusicPlayer VoiceAssistant AppLauncher WiFi Bluetooth

Example commands:
  SetBrightness 60
  ShowBattery
  SetVolume 30
  GetVolume
  SetWiFi On
  SetBluetooth Off
  PlayMusic C:\\path\\song.wav
  StopMusic
  OpenApp "VisualStudio.exe"  (searches common folders)
  OpenPDF "report.pdf"
  Speak "Hello team"
Type 'exit' to quit.

